CORE x86-preprocessing
main.cpp
--winx64 --cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ length: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ converted: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ back: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
The conversions are defined in the MSVC runtime library; without a model
their results were nondet, so a path from "a.txt" could be empty.
